        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R2004, Traditional R-Series 30\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis R-Series Towel Bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known. The traditional styling of the mounts on Deltana's R2004 towel bar makes it great for any traditional setting; and the 30 inch length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made out of solid brass, it is available in beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2004-specifications.gif?v=1704354605\" width=\"600\" height=\"182\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R2004 30\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-18-inch-towel-bar-deltana-r2002\"><b>18\" R-Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-24-inch-towel-bar-deltana-r2003\"><b>24\" R-Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the R Solid Brass 30\" Classic Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length center to center: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 32-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2004.pdf?v=1704262290\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R2004 30\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
